WEBVTT

00:00:00.606 --> 00:00:12.916
Every agent comes with seven ready made connectors: GitHub, Stripe, Notion, Atlassian, Cloudflare, Supabase and Git. Nothing is connected until you connect it, and the agent acts as you.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:18.550
Search to find one, or use the tabs to see what is connected and what needs attention.

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:28.862
Connect GitHub. It is marked high risk, so you see what it can do, then paste your own token. The token is checked, sealed in the vault, and never shown to the model.

00:00:29.463 --> 00:00:38.873
Git is connected for everyone. Open Tools to switch single tools on or off. They are listed alphabetically, and a banner warns you when too many are on.

00:00:39.477 --> 00:00:43.577
Each person connects their own account. Two people never share a token.

